WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.109 --> 00:00:01.710
(audience cheers)
- What's up!

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:02.543
- You look so good!

00:00:02.543 --> 00:00:05.200
- Thank you. Thank you. I feel good.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.550
- Yeah, you should.

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:08.730
Okay. Well, it's great
to see you in person.

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:09.898
- Great to see you too, finally.

00:00:09.898 --> 00:00:11.000
- I know, last time I was virtual, right?

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.044
- [LL Cool J] I know we've been doing

00:00:12.044 --> 00:00:12.903
a lot of Zooms.
- [Kelly] I know!

00:00:12.903 --> 00:00:14.750
- [LL Cool J] A lot of
staring at a lot of screens.

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:15.730
- We have real people now, what?

00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:16.911
- Real people in the building.

00:00:16.911 --> 00:00:17.744
(audience cheers)

00:00:17.744 --> 00:00:18.853
- What's up real people?

00:00:19.787 --> 00:00:20.850
- So, last time you were here,

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:23.020
you were giving fans
your actual phone number,

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:24.710
just because a lot of
people were having problems

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:25.543
with the pandemic.

00:00:25.543 --> 00:00:26.376
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:26.376 --> 00:00:28.160
- What was like, did you get
calls? Did you get texts?

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:29.350
- Oh I got a couple.
- [Kelly] Yeah?

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:31.010
- Yeah I got a couple of calls.

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:32.320
You know, talking to people.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:33.690
I'm talking to people's mothers.

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:36.180
Birthdays, like, you know what I'm saying?

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:37.390
Just, good vibes and energy.

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:39.760
I thought during that
time during the pandemic,

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:41.820
especially when everybody was quarantined,

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:43.970
I just wanted to make myself

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:46.060
a little bit more
available than I usually am

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:47.830
and just kind of share
some love and try to

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:48.950
lift some spirits.
- People are missing

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:49.840
connection, yeah.

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:51.539
- Yeah. Yeah. So that's what
I did. And it went well.

00:00:51.539 --> 00:00:52.720
- Okay. I have a question.

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:54.370
How many people asked you out on a date?

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:55.934
Do they call you (Kelly laughing)

00:00:55.934 --> 00:00:57.292
- Oh boy.

00:00:57.292 --> 00:00:58.280
Oh boy.

00:00:58.280 --> 00:00:59.230
- I was like, when you
gave your number out,

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:02.039
I was like, whew, he's
about to get blown up.

00:01:02.039 --> 00:01:02.872
- Oh yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:02.872 --> 00:01:04.390
That could go left real quick.
- I know.

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:05.760
- You know, when I look at it that way,

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:07.211
maybe I shouldn't have gave my number out.

00:01:07.211 --> 00:01:08.544
You know what I mean?

00:01:08.544 --> 00:01:09.485
Thinking about it that way.

00:01:09.485 --> 00:01:11.177
- How many women are going
to hit him up being like,

00:01:11.177 --> 00:01:13.722
"I'm so lonely. You should
probably come over."

00:01:13.722 --> 00:01:16.060
(all laughing)

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:18.280
What's the best part of
interacting with fans

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:19.113
like that, though?

00:01:19.113 --> 00:01:20.420
- Just the genuine love,

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:23.210
and just being connected to real people

00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:26.280
and not like, always being in that bubble.

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:29.850
The bubble is, you know, no pun intended.

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:33.050
The bubble is a crazy
thing because it's like,

00:01:33.050 --> 00:01:34.870
you could get disconnected.

00:01:34.870 --> 00:01:36.690
And I wanted to make
sure that I was connected

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:39.080
to real people going through
real life situations.

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:41.150
And so that's what it was about for me,

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:43.241
just being real and authentic.

00:01:43.241 --> 00:01:44.140
- And I think that's the thing,

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:46.780
we always hear about the
negative side of social media,

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:49.780
which there is, but there's
a lot of great things.

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:50.960
So I know, real negative

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:51.930
and we get real negative real quick,

00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:54.270
but it's a shame because
it's how we abuse it

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:55.830
because I also think
there's a lot of connections

00:01:55.830 --> 00:01:57.710
to be made there and
people can feel alone.

00:01:57.710 --> 00:01:58.900
So it's kind of a cool thing too,

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:00.460
that you're able to connect
with people like that.

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:01.573
- Yeah I think, look, you know,

00:02:01.573 --> 00:02:03.622
there's a time and place for everything,

00:02:03.622 --> 00:02:04.455
you know what I'm saying?

00:02:04.455 --> 00:02:06.170
But I do think that there
is something to be said for

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:07.270
connecting with real people

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:08.850
and just letting them know that you care,

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:11.080
especially when you're in
a position of influence.

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:12.810
It doesn't matter if every single person

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:14.170
knows everything you did.

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:15.720
When you're in a position of influence

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:17.430
and you have an effect on society,

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:18.950
sometimes you got to step up,

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:20.227
and man up a little bit and just say,

00:02:20.227 --> 00:02:22.220
"Hey, I'm here for you
to lift your spirits."

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:24.233
If nothing else, it
ain't a cure for COVID.

00:02:24.233 --> 00:02:25.892
But at least it can make people's lives

00:02:25.892 --> 00:02:26.880
- Boy, but if you have one,
- a little better.

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:28.398
just share it with the class.

00:02:28.398 --> 00:02:29.490
- A thousand percent.

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:31.382
- Wow. It's still happening.

00:02:31.382 --> 00:02:33.190
